Fix Vanadium full Trichrome bundle build.

Two independent issues block the `trichrome_chrome_bundle` target when
the Vanadium patch series is applied on Chromium 148:

1. ConfigInfo class never reaches the bundle base module's dex.
   Vanadium's patch 0135 adds `configinfo_srcjar_apk` to
   `chrome_public_apk_or_module_tmpl`'s nested `srcjar_deps`, but the
   subsequent `forward_variables_from(invoker, "*")` overwrites the
   local list with the invoker's `srcjar_deps` (in our case the
   jni_registration accumulation done by chrome_public_bundle's body),
   so configinfo_srcjar_apk gets silently dropped. R8 then sees
   `app.vanadium.config.VanadiumConfParser$ParsedConfigs` referencing
   `app.vanadium.config.ConfigInfo` but no class definition for it,
   and TraceReferences fails the bundle.

   Fix: add `//vanadium/android_config:configinfo_srcjar_apk` directly
   to the invocation block of `chrome_public_apk_or_module_tmpl` from
   `chrome_public_bundle`, alongside the jni_registration list.

2. Bundle feature modules' min_sdk_version defaults to 29 while the
   base module is bumped to 33 by Vanadium's patch 0197 — bundletool
   then refuses the bundle with "Modules cannot have a minSdkVersion
   attribute with a value lower than the one from the base module."

   Vanadium's 0197 only patches `chrome_common_apk_or_module_tmpl`,
   which builds the base module. Feature modules (on_demand,
   test_dummy, stack_unwinder, xr) go through `chrome_bundle` →
   `chrome_feature_module` and use `_min_sdk_version` derived in
   `chrome_bundle_tmpl.gni`, where it defaults to
   `default_min_sdk_version` (= 29 in M148).

   Fix: in chrome_bundle_tmpl.gni, default `_min_sdk_version` to 33
   when `_is_trichrome`, matching the base module's bumped value.

--- a/chrome/android/BUILD.gn
+++ b/chrome/android/BUILD.gn
@@ -91,6 +91,9 @@ if (_is_default_toolchain) {
       add_view_trace_events = true
 
       srcjar_deps = []
+      srcjar_deps += [
+        "//vanadium/android_config:configinfo_srcjar_apk",
+      ]
       foreach(_module_desc, chrome_module_descs) {
         if (defined(_module_desc.jni_registration)) {
           srcjar_deps += [ _module_desc.jni_registration ]
--- a/chrome/android/modules/chrome_bundle_tmpl.gni
+++ b/chrome/android/modules/chrome_bundle_tmpl.gni
@@ -101,6 +101,8 @@ template("chrome_bundle") {
 
   if (defined(invoker.min_sdk_version)) {
     _min_sdk_version = invoker.min_sdk_version
+  } else if (_is_trichrome) {
+    _min_sdk_version = 33
   } else {
     _min_sdk_version = default_min_sdk_version
   }
